{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suki never saw herself as a hero. A shy, struggling girl from the modern world, she used video games to escape her troubles\u2014until one night, the impossible happened. A glowing portal burst open from her screen and pulled her into a war-torn fantasy realm, where magic is real and danger is everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, lost in a world on the brink of destruction, Suki finds herself among the last survivors of humanity. Under the protection of the formidable Knight of War, Reina, these refugees cling to hope in a small, battered camp while ruthless demons continue their relentless assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But Suki can't hide here. Not anymore. If she wants to survive\u2014and protect her newfound friends\u2014she must confront her fears, discover hidden strengths, and become the hero this world desperately needs: a Knight of Justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will Suki rise to the challenge and embrace her destiny, or will darkness consume the last hope of humanity? The journey begins now.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3032620?t=1753417610","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3032620?t=1753417610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/d347af62ea4399cc3c99af19746f02e61b38e67f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753417610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/d347af62ea4399cc3c99af19746f02e61b38e67f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753417610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Style:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a  blend of <strong>tower defense strategy</strong> and <strong>solo exploration</strong> with a mix of magic and close combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demons are pushing humanity to the brink! Fight for survival alongside new friends, get stronger, gather resources, and recruit allies to enhance your power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/c655a06f121f4dfdea6476e595858a49.poster.avif?t=1753417610\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/c655a06f121f4dfdea6476e595858a49.webm?t=1753417610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/c655a06f121f4dfdea6476e595858a49.mp4?t=1753417610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Stories:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the world\u2019s secrets, help your allies, and reclaim what was lost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide Suki and friends as they grow, forge bonds, and overcome challenges together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/46199bf232d2889a994efe21809bb957.poster.avif?t=1753417610\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/46199bf232d2889a994efe21809bb957.webm?t=1753417610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/46199bf232d2889a994efe21809bb957.mp4?t=1753417610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Ways to Play:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face unique challenges\u2014some battles call for teamwork and strategic defense, while others demand you take on foes alone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new combat skills and recruit unique units. Can you rally everyone to victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/1eb147952e9d71d322b47f3d1e2dc85f.poster.avif?t=1753417610\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/1eb147952e9d71d322b47f3d1e2dc85f.webm?t=1753417610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/1eb147952e9d71d322b47f3d1e2dc85f.mp4?t=1753417610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suki never saw herself as a hero. A shy, struggling girl from the modern world, she used video games to escape her troubles\u2014until one night, the impossible happened. A glowing portal burst open from her screen and pulled her into a war-torn fantasy realm, where magic is real and danger is everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, lost in a world on the brink of destruction, Suki finds herself among the last survivors of humanity. Under the protection of the formidable Knight of War, Reina, these refugees cling to hope in a small, battered camp while ruthless demons continue their relentless assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But Suki can't hide here. Not anymore. If she wants to survive\u2014and protect her newfound friends\u2014she must confront her fears, discover hidden strengths, and become the hero this world desperately needs: a Knight of Justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will Suki rise to the challenge and embrace her destiny, or will darkness consume the last hope of humanity? The journey begins now.</p>","developers":["StarFlow Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/b7b8a27768b4f10a4f178b3cfe1dfedebe1930dd/header.jpg?t=1753417610","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257173709,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173709/movie480.mp4?t=1753417608","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173709/movie_max.mp4?t=1753417608"},"name":"KOJ1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173709/903c408143ba6035e4c0be4dd436f76c44ed4a16/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753417608","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173709/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753417608","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173709/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753417608"}}],"name":"Knight of Justice","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-7100 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950 / 1050 or AMD Radeo